# Path and Walk

`Command.Path()` returns the list of command names from the root to the
current command. `Command.Walk()` visits a command and every subcommand
recursively, calling a function on each.

## Path

The `Path()` method returns `[]string` where each element is a `Command.Name`
starting from the root. `FullName()` is equivalent to
`strings.Join(cmd.Path(), " ")`.

<!-- {
  "output": "top mid bottom"
} -->
```go
package main

import (
	"context"
	"fmt"
	"strings"

	"github.com/urfave/cli/v3"
)

func main() {
	subSubCmd := &cli.Command{
		Name: "bottom",
		Action: func(ctx context.Context, c *cli.Command) error {
			fmt.Println(strings.Join(c.Path(), " "))
			return nil
		},
	}
	subCmd := &cli.Command{Name: "mid", Commands: []*cli.Command{subSubCmd}, Action: func(context.Context, *cli.Command) error { return nil }}
	cmd := &cli.Command{
		Name:     "top",
		Commands: []*cli.Command{subCmd},
	}

	cmd.Run(context.Background(), []string{"top", "mid", "bottom"})
}
```

```sh-session
$ go run .
top mid bottom
```

## Walk

`Walk()` traverses the command tree depth-first, visiting the command itself
first, then each subcommand recursively.

<!-- {
  "output": "top\nmid\nbottom"
} -->
```go
package main

import (
	"context"
	"fmt"

	"github.com/urfave/cli/v3"
)

func main() {
	subSubCmd := &cli.Command{Name: "bottom", Action: func(context.Context, *cli.Command) error { return nil }}
	subCmd := &cli.Command{Name: "mid", Commands: [...", "path": "docs/v3/path-and-walk.md", "retrieval_provenance": {"blob_sha": "8054860ef052a0d79de51ede5886c113102a9f1b", "discovery_source": "base_sha_tree", "excluded_artifact_paths": 11, "generator_pool_policy": "base_sha_broad_bounded_doc_pool_v2", "max_generator_doc_chars_per_file": 1500, "max_generator_doc_files": 12, "method": "base_sha_tree_documentation_discovery_v2", "path": "docs/v3/path-and-walk.md", "selection_policy": "prefer_first_party_human_docs_then_root_project_docs_then_reference_plus_neutral_code_path_affinity", "selection_rank": 1, "selection_score": [45, 4, 5, 3, "docs/v3/path-and-walk.md"], "tree_discovery_succeeded": true, "tree_ref": "d04da995131aaf8b8dc945e56b10321a8e715472", "truncated": false, "truncated_excerpt": true, "used_docs_changed_files": false}, "source_ref": "d04da995131aaf8b8dc945e56b10321a8e715472"}, {"blob_sha": "a8b2c6ec480e1675ea700c92fc9df96e36a53ed9", "excerpt": "---
