Using the timestamp flag is simple. Please refer to
[`time.Parse`](https://golang.org/pkg/time/#example_Parse) to get possible
formats.

<!-- {
  "args": ["&#45;&#45;meeting", "2019-08-12T15:04:05"],
  "output": "2019\\-08\\-12 15\\:04\\:05 \\+0000 UTC"
} -->
```go
package main

import (
	"fmt"
	"log"
	"os"

	"github.com/urfave/cli/v2"
)

func main() {
	app := &cli.App{
		Flags: []cli.Flag{
			&cli.TimestampFlag{Name: "meeting", Layout: "2006-01-02T15:04:05"},
		},
		Action: func(cCtx *cli.Context) error {
			fmt.Printf("%s", cCtx.Timestamp("meeting").String())
			return nil
		},
	}

	if err := app.Run(os.Args); err != nil {
		log.Fatal(err)
	}
}
```

In this example the flag could be used like this:

```sh-session
$ myapp --meeting 2019-08-12T15:04:05
```

When the layout doesn't contain timezones, timestamp will render with UTC. To
change behavior, a default timezone can be provided with flag definition:

```go
app := &cli.App{
	Flags: []cli.Flag{
		&cli.TimestampFlag{Name: "meeting", Layout: "2006-01-02T15:04:05", Timezone: time.Local},
	},
}
```

(time.Local contains the system's local time zone.)

Side note: quotes may be necessary around the date depending on your layout (if
you have spaces for instance)", "path": "docs/v2/examples/timestamp-flag.md", "retrieval_provenance": {"blob_sha": "4e19adfd139c97153cfeeb7d5aa5b398c4c76170", "discovery_source": "base_sha_tree", "excluded_artifact_paths": 11, "generator_pool_policy": "base_sha_broad_bounded_doc_pool_v2", "max_generator_doc_chars_per_file": 1500, "max_generator_doc_files": 12, "method": "base_sha_tree_documentation_discovery_v2", "path": "docs/v2/examples/timestamp-flag.md", "selection_policy": "prefer_first_party_human_docs_then_root_project_docs_then_reference_plus_neutral_code_path_affinity", "selection_rank": 1, "selection_score": [45, 5, 5, 4, "docs/v2/examples/timestamp-flag.md"], "tree_discovery_succeeded": true, "tree_ref": "84d0da5c2dea82f19c9bce4bdf255ee1091231fa", "truncated": false, "truncated_excerpt": true, "used_docs_changed_files": false}, "source_ref": "84d0da5c2dea82f19c9bce4bdf255ee1091231fa"}, {"blob_sha": "f9d588db7a5201a5f5bf63f6a5396edd6e3f26ad", "excerpt": "---
